# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Per-skill local overlay: machine-local values, shipped as symlinks to a private repo.
# This single pattern is load-bearing twice: git ignores the dir, and the harness skill loader
# reads .gitignore too, so a stray SKILL.md inside it can never be discovered. Do not narrow it.
**/local/

# Root READMEs are repo documentation, not skills. The skill loader reads .gitignore too,
# and some harnesses register this directory itself as a skill dir and load root-level .md
# files as skills; anchoring keeps the READMEs out of that discovery (other tools hide them too).
/README.md
/README.zh-CN.md
